    "faq": {
      "type": "ca-faq-list",
      "blocks": {
        "item_1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is the first test really free?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Your first A/B test is completely free, no strings attached. It's our way of showing the value of optimization before you commit to anything. The only cost is a monthly subscription to the A/B testing Shopify tool we use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How much traffic does my store need to run A/B tests?",
            "answer": "<p>We typically recommend at least 30,000 monthly visitors to ensure results reach statistical significance. If you're under that, we can still help with other CRO strategies like heatmaps, user testing, or a design audit.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I need to sign a long-term contract?",
            "answer": "<p>A/B testing is an ongoing process. It requires consistent iteration to drive meaningful results. That said, not everything needs a long-term commitment. We offer flat-rate pricing for one-time services like landing page design or a CRO audit if you just need a starting point.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long do tests take?",
            "answer": "<p>Test duration depends on your traffic. Higher-traffic stores can reach meaningful results in as little as 1–2 weeks, while lower-traffic stores may take longer. We'll help you prioritize what to test and when.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "item_1",
